    self assert: #[Adr0131ExcProducerClass inCollect, (Adr0131ExcProducerValue new) inCollect, (Adr0131ExcProducerActor spawn) inCollect] equals: #[#[#(2, 4), 3], #[#(2, 4), 3], #[#(2, 4), 3]]

  testInInject =>
    self assert: #[Adr0131ExcProducerClass inInject, (Adr0131ExcProducerValue new) inInject] equals: #[#[3, 3], #[3, 3]]

